From ae06b3bd1d15c0a084d292dd51acbb2f366322aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Nylander <yeager@users.noreply.gitlab.gnome.org>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 20:29:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gpu: Add AMDGPU metrics

Read AMDGPU utilization and memory metrics from DRM sysfs. Keep the card path while enumerating devices, so mixed-driver systems do not read metrics from the wrong card.
